              "content": "Two layers, one slot: the icon says where the work is in its git journey (branch → draft → PR → merged), the corner badge says whether the agent is alive on it right now. Today those fight for one slot — session icons hide the workflow icon.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "WtJKR",
              "name": "C2",
              "fill": "$note-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Deus stores only pr_url + pr_number — derive the rest like Conductor does (it ships gh): gh pr view --json state,isDraft,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus → local · draft · open · changes-requested · approved · conflicts · merged · closed. Cache on the workspace, refresh on focus + after agent turns.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XrjOC",
              "name": "C3",
              "fill": "$note-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Manual workflow (backlog · canceled) stays as a right-click override, like Conductor's manual_status. Fork/linked marks workspaces spun off another workspace's branch.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
