              "fill": "$note-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Model: starred_at TEXT on workspaces (additive column, same mechanism as pr_*). Starred rows form one cross-repo STARRED section above all repo groups — the focus set — ordered by starred_at. Repo hint (muted) after the title disambiguates; rows keep their normal state icon + signal. Toggle = q:mutate like archiveWorkspace.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KcvMr",
              "name": "N2",
              "fill": "$note-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Starred rows stay in their repo group too (single source of truth, no duplication confusion: section is a view, group is home — like Linear favorites). Section hidden when empty. Tiny star glyph next to the meta signal marks starred rows inside their home group.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
